      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:proclus.homily13.budge",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲛⲁⲩ ϭⲉ **ⲟⲩⲛ** · ϫⲉⲉⲕⲧⲛⲧⲱⲛ ⲉⲛⲓⲙ ·",
      "english": "Look now, and consider; whom dost thou resemble?",
